    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">\r\nHi D-RUGgies!\r\n<div>We are at the end of another school year here at UC Davis, and it is time to celebrate our survival and to say goodbye to some folks who will graduate and move outside of the D-RUG radius. I&#39;d like to have a get-together at Village Pizza in Davis, and\r\n hopefully sometime this weekend or next week (I know it is late notice - sorry!)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Here&#39;s a whenisgood link. Please select times when you would come and I&#39;ll pick from those times. Since I am asking for dates in the very near future, please pick times right away!</div>\r\n<div style=\"display:block\">\r\n<div style=\"display:inline-block\" role=\"link\">\r\n<a style=\"border-radius:10px;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;width:300px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://whenisgood.net/8texshj\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"button\" width=\"300\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://whenisgood.net/8texshj&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464742612000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3kaTdUs2RrONzrvo4w_vI6\">\r\n<table style=\"table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;width:300px;background-color:#e5e6e9;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"300\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#E5E6E9\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"300\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;table-layout:fixed;background-color:rgba(229,230,233,1)\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:8px 0px 8px 0px\">\r\n<div style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0px 16px 0px 16px;overflow:hidden\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:left\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://whenisgood.net/8texshj\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://whenisgood.net/8texshj&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464742612000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3kaTdUs2RrONzrvo4w_vI6\"><font color=\"#272727\" style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.847059)\">D-RUG end-of-year celebration</font></a></div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;font-weight:400;font-size:11px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:left\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://whenisgood.net/8texshj\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://whenisgood.net/8texshj&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464742612000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3kaTdUs2RrONzrvo4w_vI6\"><font color=\"#808080\" style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.498039)\">whenisgood.net</font></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding:6px 12px 6px 0px\" width=\"36\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://whenisgood.net/8texshj\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://whenisgood.net/8texshj&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464742612000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3kaTdUs2RrONzrvo4w_vI6\"><img style=\"display:inline-block;width:36px;min-height:36px;border-radius:3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" alt=\"favicon.ico\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/attach/1fbaea2a1df5b/favicon.ico?part=0.1\"></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Thanks for a great year, and of course I&#39;ll hope to see you in an hour and a half for our final mini-workshop this quarter as Liza shows off how to use regular expressions to get data from text.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>-Wes</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
